es, systematically vary formulation parameters, measure performance, analyse results, and identify an optimum formulation."}]},{"heading":"Certifications and learning","kind":"certifications","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Area","Useful learning"],"rows":[[{"text":"Polymer science"},{"text":"Polymer processing and characterisation"}],[{"text":"Formulation"},{"text":"Formulation development fundamentals"}],[{"text":"Quality"},{"text":"GMP/GLP fundamentals"}],[{"text":"Quality systems"},{"text":"ISO 9001 concepts"}],[{"text":"Laboratory"},{"text":"Chemical safety and laboratory practices"}],[{"text":"Statistics"},{"text":"DOE and statistical analysis"}],[{"text":"Data"},{"text":"Advanced Excel + Python/R"}],[{"text":"Instrumentation"},{"text":"FTIR, DSC, TGA, GPC and rheology"}],[{"text":"Manufacturing"},{"text":"Lean/Six Sigma fundamentals"}],[{"text":"Research"},{"text":"Scientific writing and experimental design"}]]},{"type":"p","text":"Certificates should remain secondary to actual formulation projects and laboratory competence."}]},{"heading":"Careers you can be hired as","kind":"careers","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Direct-entry roles"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Formulation Assistant"},{"text":"Formulation Technician"},{"text":"R&D Assistant"},{"text":"R&D Laboratory Assistant"},{"text":"QC Chemist"},{"text":"Laboratory Chemist"},{"text":"Polymer Laboratory Assistant"},{"text":"Product Development Assistant"},{"text":"Materials Testing Assistant"},{"text":"Process Development Assistant"}]},{"type":"h","text":"With experience"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Formulation Chemist"},{"text":"R&D Executive"},{"text":"Polymer Technologist"},{"text":"Product Development Chemist"},{"text":"Process Development Chemist"},{"text":"Materials Scientist"},{"text":"Technical Service Executive"},{"text":"Application Development Executive"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Employer skill requirements"},{"type":"table","header":["Employer","Skills valued"],"rows":[[{"text":"